.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH portensor-distributed-plan 1  "plan "
.SH NAME
portensor\-distributed\-plan \- Print a shell script that runs every shard locally and merges the reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBplan\fR [\fB\-\-shards\fR] [\fB\-\-shell\fR] [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISCAN_ARGS\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a shell script that runs every shard locally and merges the reports
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-shards\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 8]
Number of deterministic target shards
.TP
\fB\-\-shell\fR \fI<SHELL>\fR [default: bash]
Shell syntax for the generated script
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.RE
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write the script to FILE instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISCAN_ARGS\fR>
Scan command and arguments, prefixed with `scan`
